{"text":"The shared bearer authorizes reads. The first wizard user's explicit `full` grant is bound to the\nmTLS certificate enrolled by `aimee remote set`; the bearer alone cannot exercise it. Additional\nusers need a short-lived KB-signed identity token and a grant for the exact\n`(server_id, team_id, subject)`. `data` covers memory, docs, and index ingestion. `full` also covers\nagent, delegate, runner, and workspace control.","range":{"byteOffset":{"start":11230,"end":11649},"start":{"line":313,"column":0},"end":{"line":317,"column":47}},"file":"/tmp/aimee-s1-b06-production-5ox9qqoh/work/MANUAL.md","lines":"The shared bearer authorizes reads. The first wizard user's explicit `full` grant is bound to the\nmTLS certificate enrolled by `aimee remote set`; the bearer alone cannot exercise it. Additional\nusers need a short-lived KB-signed identity token and a grant for the exact\n`(server_id, team_id, subject)`. `data` covers memory, docs, and index ingestion. `full` also covers\nagent, delegate, runner, and workspace control.","charCount":{"leading":0,"trailing":0},"language":"Markdown"}
