{"text":"All 30 \"schema failures\" across all four models were the literal string `{}` or\n`[]`, on notes asserting no durable fact. **Zero were malformed.** The models\nwere abstaining correctly and saying so tersely; the runner recorded anything\nwithout a `facts` array as a failure. Production agreed with the models, not the\nmetric, `mf_commit_facts()` commits nothing either way.","range":{"byteOffset":{"start":2795,"end":3167},"start":{"line":70,"column":0},"end":{"line":74,"column":55}},"file":"/tmp/aimee-s1-b06-production-5ox9qqoh/work/bench/tier-a/MEASUREMENT_LOG.md","lines":"All 30 \"schema failures\" across all four models were the literal string `{}` or\n`[]`, on notes asserting no durable fact. **Zero were malformed.** The models\nwere abstaining correctly and saying so tersely; the runner recorded anything\nwithout a `facts` array as a failure. Production agreed with the models, not the\nmetric, `mf_commit_facts()` commits nothing either way.","charCount":{"leading":0,"trailing":0},"language":"Markdown"}
{"text":"`kb_server` ≠ `KB server`, `aimee-kb` ≠ `aimee kb`, `Dr. Okafor` ≠ `Dr Okafor`.\nEndpoints had to match exactly under a normaliser that preserved underscores and\nhyphens. Models write snake_case constantly.","range":{"byteOffset":{"start":3620,"end":3831},"start":{"line":87,"column":0},"end":{"line":89,"column":44}},"file":"/tmp/aimee-s1-b06-production-5ox9qqoh/work/bench/tier-a/MEASUREMENT_LOG.md","lines":"`kb_server` ≠ `KB server`, `aimee-kb` ≠ `aimee kb`, `Dr. Okafor` ≠ `Dr Okafor`.\nEndpoints had to match exactly under a normaliser that preserved underscores and\nhyphens. Models write snake_case constantly.","charCount":{"leading":0,"trailing":0},"language":"Markdown"}
